schema AccountWorldBinding
generation account-world-1
authority BonfyreCMS + authenticated account boundary

field world_id
  type u64
  required true
  role existing-cms-world-row
field subject
  type text
  required true
  role authenticated-account-subject
field namespace
  type text
  required true
  role authorized-cms-namespace

invariant binding-checks-existing-world
  statement binding requires the existing draft World to carry the same namespace and subject; an unbound or different World cannot be adopted
invariant caller-authenticates
  statement the calling boundary authenticates the subject and authorizes the namespace before invoking the internal owner; the owner does not authenticate caller-supplied strings
forbidden_inference an account-world binding -> source rights, public audience, authenticated caller, publication or renderer availability

schema AccountWorldSpace
generation account-world-1
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field world_id
  type u64
  required true
field space_id
  type text
  required true
field title
  type text
  required true
field renderer
  type enum
  values 2d 3d
  required true
field template_ref
  type text
  required true
field layout_ref
  type text
  required true
field revision
  type u64
  required true

invariant bounded-spaces
  statement each World holds at most 32 named spaces and each write checks the current binding and draft World within one transaction
invariant bound-identity
  statement a bound World cannot be deleted or have its identity, subject, or namespace changed until a separate lifecycle owner exists
invariant revision-check
  statement create uses revision zero and updates require the exact current revision; conflicts never overwrite
forbidden_inference a template or layout reference -> a resolved object, permission to show its material, a working immersive room or a published route

schema AccountWorldSpaceStyle
generation account-world-2
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field medium
  type text
  required true
  role open-vocabulary-lowercase-word
field character
  type text
  required true
  role cue-compiled-world-character
field lede
  type text
  required false

invariant medium-is-open
  statement medium is an owner's own lowercase word (radio, podcast, poetry or anything else); it labels the space and never selects a schema, workflow or industry preset
forbidden_inference a medium word -> station operations, a podcast feed, a newsroom workflow or any vertical-specific object

schema AccountWorldItem
generation account-world-2
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field position
  type u64
  required true
  role 1..24
field ref
  type text
  required true
  role pagecomposition-source-key-or-sibling-space
field role
  type text
  required true
field note
  type text
  required false

invariant reference-only
  statement an item is "<source>/<24 hex key>" or "space:<id>" naming a sibling space in the same World; no URL, copy, rights statement or resolved body is stored
forbidden_inference an item reference -> the material still exists, is licensed for display, or belongs to the account

schema AccountWorldRelease
generation account-world-2
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field state
  type enum
  values public withdrawn
  required true
field revision
  type u64
  required true

invariant exact-revision-release
  statement release copies the draft style and items at the exact current revision; later draft edits stay private until the next release; one public space per site address
invariant withdrawal
  statement withdrawal removes the released items and the reader answers 410; ending or unbinding the World removes every space from the public address
forbidden_inference a released space -> a published World row, source rights or a live playback right

schema AccountWorldScreening
generation account-world-cine
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field screening_id
  type text
  required true
  role lowercase-slug-per-space
field starts
  type text
  required true
  role iso-minute-YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM
field venue
  type text
  required true
field ref
  type text
  required true
  role pagecomposition-film-reference
field note
  type text
  required false
field state
  type enum
  values draft announced cancelled
  required true

invariant announce-to-publish
  statement a new or edited screening is a draft; only announced and cancelled screenings of a released public space are read publicly; at most 48 per space
invariant public-domain-playback
  statement the reader plays a screening only when the source, re-read on that request, states public domain or CC0 and gives an https video file
forbidden_inference a screening -> a right to show the film, a booking, attendance or availability elsewhere

schema AccountWorldClub
generation account-world-cine
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding + authenticated member subject

field state
  type enum
  values open closed
  required true
field member_state
  type enum
  values member left removed
  required true
field pick_state
  type enum
  values open hidden
  required true
field post_state
  type enum
  values shown hidden retracted
  required true

invariant members-only
  statement picks and posts are read only by the World's subject (host) and current members of an open club on a released public space; members never see hidden rows
invariant moderation
  statement the host hides posts and picks and removes members; a removed member cannot rejoin; an author retracts their own post and its words are cleared; one vote per member per pick
forbidden_inference club membership -> enrolment, a course, a credential, an audience count or a moderation decision by anyone but the host

schema AccountWorldNote
generation account-world-cine
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field ref
  type text
  required true
  role pagecomposition-film-reference
field watched
  type text
  required true
  role iso-day
field rating
  type u64
  required true
  role 0..10-half-stars-0-unrated
field rewatch
  type bool
  required true
field body
  type text
  required false
field visibility
  type enum
  values private public
  required true

invariant private-stays-private
  statement a private note is read only by the World's subject; a public note shows only beside a film that is an item of a released public space
forbidden_inference a public rating -> an aggregate score, a moderated review or a claim about the film's rights

schema AccountWorldSound
generation account-world-audio-1
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field kind
  type enum
  values station show
  required true
field timezone
  type text
  required true
  role iana-zone-or-utc
field language
  type text
  required true
field author
  type text
  required true
field category
  type text
  required true
field explicit
  type bool
  required true
field stream_ref
  type text
  required false
  role pagecomposition-source-key

invariant draft-and-released-copy
  statement each sound row, slot, episode and mark has a draft copy (released 0) and a public copy (released 1) written only by triggers on account_world_release inside the release transaction and removed on withdrawal
forbidden_inference a station or show row -> a broadcast licence, a live stream that is up or a feed accepted by any directory

schema AccountWorldSlot
generation account-world-audio-1
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field slot
  type u64
  required true
  role 1..48
field weekday
  type u64
  required true
  role iso-1-monday..7-sunday
field start_minute
  type u64
  required true
  role 0..1439-station-clock
field minutes
  type u64
  required true
  role 1..1440
field programme
  type text
  required true
field host
  type text
  required false
field ref
  type text
  required false
  role pagecomposition-source-key-or-sibling-space
forbidden_inference a slot -> that the programme aired, or the time in any zone but the station's

schema AccountWorldEpisode
generation account-world-audio-1
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field ref
  type text
  required true
  role existing-item-of-the-space
field season
  type u64
  required true
field number
  type u64
  required true
field published
  type date
  required true
forbidden_inference an episode date -> a right to distribute its recording

schema AccountWorldMark
generation account-world-audio-1
authority BonfyreCMS + AccountWorldBinding

field ref
  type text
  required true
  role existing-item-of-the-space
field kind
  type enum
  values track chapter cue clip person source
  required true
field start_ms
  type u64
  required true
field end_ms
  type u64
  required false
  role required-for-cue-and-clip
field title
  type text
  required true
field credit
  type text
  required false
field href
  type text
  required false
  role https-citation-or-pagecomposition-key-never-played
field checked
  type bool
  required true
  role confirmed-track-or-reviewed-cue-or-clip

invariant review-before-public
  statement unreviewed cues and clips never reach the public page, transcript file or feed; unconfirmed tracks reach the page only with a flag
forbidden_inference a confirmed track or reviewed line -> licence to play the track or a claim of transcription accuracy
